# Airline evaluator API

This file is the evaluator-facing contract. The required scope and output below
are fixed. The sole factual input is `itinerary content W.Itinerary`; do not add
inputs or change the shared factual types. Add internal variables and policy
subscopes without renaming or removing the fixed input, scope, or output.

- Requirement ID `AIRLINE-TOTAL-COST`: scope `TotalCost`, output `total_cost`.

> Module Api
> Using Definitions as W
> Using AirlinePolicy as S1

```catala-metadata
declaration scope TotalCost:
  input itinerary content W.Itinerary
  # Add internal variables and policy subscopes here; do not add inputs.
  # Keep the predeclared input and output unchanged.
  output total_cost content money
```

```catala
# Define TotalCost.total_cost by composing the policy scope. Keep evaluator
# orchestration here rather than assigning it to an individual policy span.
```
